      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The traveling priest casts a spell that takes 1 or more actions and affects only them</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The traveling priest Strides up to 10 feet, or up to their full Speed if the triggering spell took 2 actions or more to cast.</p>",
