      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>A traveling priest with a message to deliver is continually protected by a DC 25 Sanctuary spell. If the traveling priest breaks the <em>sanctuary</em>, the effect returns if the traveling priest ceases hostility for 10 minutes.</p>",
